 12   4010              ; The mappers measured: each 8 KB block of this cartridge holds its number
 13   4010              ; in its last byte. The program, copied to the RAM, reads the four 8 KB
 14   4010              ; windows of pages 1 and 2 at the start, then after each write of a list.
